cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Ninja Harness in your work, please cite it."
title: "Ninja Harness: Trace-first evaluation and certification for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  Ninja Harness is an open-source, framework-agnostic evaluation harness for
  agentic AI systems. It scores the full execution trajectory (plan, tool calls,
  handoffs, guardrails, recovery) into a composite reliability index with a
  PASS/WARN/FAIL certification, reports pass^k reliability across repeated runs,
  maps safety findings to OWASP LLM Top 10 and MITRE ATLAS, and integrates with
  CI via SARIF/JUnit.
type: software
